  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender, Diversity, Equity, Inclusivity Funds</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With funding from PeaceNexus, International Alert has commissioned a Gender, Diveristy, Equity and Inclusion (GDEI) Steering Committee to support the organisation to rebalance power dynamics, reshape policies and improve equitability in Alert&apos;s internal processes. This Committee is composed of representatives across Alert&apos;s London and Hague offices as well as country offices and is integrated into Alert&apos;s Executive Team to help guide decision-making through a GDEI lens.</narrative>
  </description>
